cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "probabilistic-csd-reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  Code for "Separating Where to Measure from What is Measured: Charge
  Stability Diagram Reconstruction in Double Quantum Dots". A U-Net trained
  on simulated devices predicts the charge-transition lines of a double
  quantum dot from a few one-dimensional ray sweeps (Step 1); short local
  sweeps around the prediction keep a line only where the charge-sensor
  signal steps (Step 2).
